Spell-IT-OUT preprocessing audit trail
======================================

These project-specific tables preserve the complete human-review record.
annotationsqc: automatic candidates and manual artifact annotations with review decisions.
channelqc: PyPREP evidence and final manual channel decisions.
channelplan: condition-level interpolation/exclusion plan used for ICA.
icadecisions: ICLabel evidence and final component decisions.
icaprovenance: exact ICA preparation, rank, convergence, and fit metadata.

Paths referring to minproc or ICA-input checkpoints identify working pipeline artifacts that are reproducible but not included in this release.
